# Post-change verification

After making code, docs, pipeline, or script changes in this repo, run this chain and ensure **every step exits 0** before treating the work as done:

```bash
node scripts/quality/normalize-md-tables.mjs && node scripts/quality/check-markdown-links.mjs && ./scripts/quality/format-code.sh && ./scripts/quality/validate-pre-commit.sh
```

- Do not skip steps or stop early on the first success.
- If a step fails, fix the issue and re-run the full chain.
- Prefer running the full chain once at the end of a change set (not after every tiny edit), unless an intermediate failure needs isolation.
- When dependency versions or Selenium Grid pins change, also run `./scripts/quality/validate-dependency-versions.sh` and ensure it exits 0.
